  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your dripping touch dampens fires.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Water Skinned<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can extinguish a fire of up to 5 square feet as a swift or move action. You may extinguish a 5-foot cube of fire as a standard action, and if you expend one use of your mythic power you may all non-magical fire in a 10-foot cube or a single 5-foot cube of magical fire (as dispel magic, using your level plus your mythic tier for the caster level check).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
